        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (30–40 words).** Write about five countries: what nationality the people are and what language they speak.\n\n**Speak (about 30 seconds).** Say aloud which countries you have a connection with and which languages you speak, well or badly."
